{"text": "Thistledown Health Plan · Member Services 1-800-555-0139 (TTY 711) · members.thistledownhp.example/eob\n\nExplanation of Benefits\n\nTHIS IS NOT A BILL. Keep this statement for your records.\n\nGARETH T DUQUETTE\n618 Larkmoor Lane\nBEND OR 97702-1184\n\nStatement date\n\n01/22/2026\n\nSubscriber\n\nGareth T. Duquette\n\nMember ID\n\nTHP 884 201 557 01\n\nGroup\n\n0G7741-B (Pennywhistle Brewing Cooperative)\n\nPatient\n\nElodie Duquette (dependent 02, daughter of the subscriber) DOB 06/19/2017\n\nClaim 2026-0114-77302-A\n\nProvider: Naveen Iyer, MD, Wexford Children's ENT Associates (NPI 1730458821) — in network.\nFacility: Quartzite Surgery Center of Bend. Diagnosis on claim: J35.3, enlarged tonsils and adenoids with obstructive sleep apnea.\n\nDate of service\tService\tBilled\tPlan discount\tPlan paid\tYou owe\tRemark\n\n12/18/2025\tOffice visit, pre-op (CPT 99213)\t$212.00\t$71.85\t$0.00\t$140.15\tPR-1\n\n01/06/2026\tTonsillectomy and adenoidectomy, under age 12 (CPT 42820)\t$3,870.00\t$1,596.00\t$1,819.20\t$454.80\tCO-45\n\n01/06/2026\tFacility fee\t$5,140.00\t$2,313.00\t$2,737.80\t$89.20\tCO-45\n\nTotals\t$9,222.00\t$3,980.85\t$4,557.00\t$684.15\n\nClaim 2026-0114-77302-B\n\nProvider: Saltmarsh Anesthesia Partners (out of network; processed at the in-network level because Dr. Iyer chose the facility).\n\nDate of service\tService\tBilled\tPlan paid\tYou owe\n\n01/06/2026\tAnesthesia, tonsil procedure, child under 12 (CPT 00170); claim attachment notes allergy to amoxicillin\t$1,460.00\t$1,168.00\t$292.00\n\nHow your family deductible is tracking\n\nFamily deductible $3,000.00; met so far this plan year $1,412.60. Out-of-pocket maximum $7,900.\n\nYour payment\n\nYour $684.15 balance to Wexford was paid on Jan. 20 from the card on file, Visa ending in 6352 (Marguerite Duquette, exp. 11/27). Receipt no. RCP-5530921 was sent to m.duquette@mailhost.example. The Saltmarsh balance of $292.00 has not been paid.\n\nMessages\n\nHi Gareth — Elodie’s follow-up visi